From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Marcin Juszkiewicz <mjuszkiewicz@redhat.com>
Date: Wed, 23 Sep 2026 12:00:02 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Tests: Match RPM keyring lock error in CPack_RPM test

Newer RPM versions (Fedora 46+) emit "can't create keyring lock"
instead of "can't create transaction lock". Accept both.

Upstream: https://gitlab.kitware.com/cmake/cmake/-/commit/98d9cddffe03432e6bcd88ab69abf669deff8d7c
---
 Tests/RunCMake/CPack_RPM/Basic-verify-stderr.txt | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/Tests/RunCMake/CPack_RPM/Basic-verify-stderr.txt b/Tests/RunCMake/CPack_RPM/Basic-verify-stderr.txt
index 059e62937b..919632def6 100644
--- a/Tests/RunCMake/CPack_RPM/Basic-verify-stderr.txt
+++ b/Tests/RunCMake/CPack_RPM/Basic-verify-stderr.txt
@@ -1,2 +1,2 @@
-^(error: can't create transaction lock[^
+^(error: can't create (transaction|keyring) lock[^
 ]*)?$
